@@Sourdough
@Cooking

A loaf with a crisp crust and an open crumb. See [Structure/#Library] for
the rest of the cookbook.

# Starter
**Feeding:**
- Equal weights of starter, flour and water
- Twice a day at room temperature

# Method
Mix:
    - 500 g flour, 350 g water, 100 g starter, 10 g salt
Bulk:
    - 4-5 hours, four sets of stretch and folds
Bake:
    - 250 °C covered 20 min, then 230 °C uncovered 20 min

| Step | Time |
|------|------|
| Bulk | 5 h  |
| Proof | overnight |

> The dough is ready when it jiggles and has grown about 50%.
